Build a complete, production-ready **Declutter Business Sales & Inventory Management System**.

The system is an internal web application for a declutter/resale business. It should allow **staff to record sales and payments**, while **admins manage inventory, customers, categories, sales, purchases, and business performance**.

The application must feel like a modern SaaS business application: clean, premium, simple, fast, professional, and highly usable.

