# 42. BUSINESS LOGIC RULES

These rules are critical.

### Inventory

Purchased quantity = total quantity originally acquired.

Sold quantity = total quantity sold.

Remaining quantity = purchased quantity - sold quantity.

### Sale

Total sale = quantity × selling price per unit.

### Payment

Amount paid = sum of all payments associated with the sale.

Balance = total sale - amount paid.

### Status

If balance = 0:

PAID

If amount paid > 0 AND balance > 0:

PARTIALLY PAID

If amount paid = 0:

UNPAID

### Inventory status

If remaining quantity = 0:

SOLD OUT

If sold quantity > 0 AND remaining quantity > 0:

PARTIALLY SOLD

If sold quantity = 0:

AVAILABLE

